  "content": "<p>桃幻想鄉 這是一個受東方Project啟發的模組包，採用完整的RPG風格並充滿任務</p><p>版本 1.20.1</p><p>建議搭配幻想鄉地圖遊玩</p><p>------------------</p><p>桃幻想鄉是一個試圖模仿東方Project風格、充滿任務的RPG體驗模組包。</p><p>版本 1.20.1&nbsp;<br><br>設計為搭配東方Project相關地圖遊玩</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>模組包內含模組：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER) (by way2muchnoise)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terramity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terramity (by Aurukel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-crits\" rel=\"nofollow\">隨機暴擊 (by InfernalEclipse)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corail-tombstone\" rel=\"nofollow\">珊瑚墓碑 (by Corail_31)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quests-kill-task-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">任務擊殺任務調整 (by MuonR)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/feathers\" rel=\"nofollow\">羽毛 (by ElenaiDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illage-and-spillage-finally-ported\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠奪與溢出：重新溢出 (by TheDarkPeasant)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/what-are-they-up-to\" rel=\"nofollow\">他們在做什麼 (Watut) (by Corosus)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modernfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModernFix (by embeddedt)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-me-despawn\" rel=\"nofollow\">讓我消失 (by frikinjay)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI) (by mezz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/max-health-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">最大生命值修復 (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-skill-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\">默認技能樹 (by Pufferfish)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.